================================================================================
RESPONSIBLE USE
================================================================================

BridgeLab is defensive security research. It exists to help teams detect the
moment a manipulated AI agent turns its own legitimate identity into an attack,
and every technique it runs emits telemetry for that purpose. Run it only
against the throwaway sandbox it ships with (Keycloak + LocalStack) or a
dedicated, non-production test tenant you own and are authorized to test. Live
destructive paths are gated behind an explicit flag and must never be pointed at
anything real. You are responsible for how you use this code. See the
"Responsible use" note in README.md.


